Ask "What is our income for the month?" and call the answer income.
Ask "What is our rent?" and call the answer rent.
Ask "What are our utilities?" and call the answer utilities.
Ask "What is our insurance?" and call the answer insurance.
Ask "What is our phone bill?" and call the answer phone.
Let bills be rent plus utilities plus insurance plus phone.
Let left be income minus bills.
Say left.
If left is less than 500, say "Please be careful, we have less than $500 left this month."
Ask "How much do we want to save each month?" and call the answer savings.
Let months be 5000 divided by savings.
Say months.
